2	 * send-sequence-step
3	 *
4	 * Cron worker — invoked every 5 minutes via pg_cron or Supabase Dashboard Cron Jobs.
5	 * Picks up to 50 pending sequence_sends whose scheduled_for <= now(),
6	 * renders the step template with candidate variables, sends via Resend, and
7	 * updates send status.
